        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Trade Sales obtains tax-exempt certification: government agency DOM (Department Order/Memorandum), diplomatic VAT exemption certificate from DOF/BIR
Responsible (R): Trade Sales
Accountable (A): Trade Sales Manager
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2906_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2906_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2906_Task7" name="Tax Accountant validates exemption scope and authority; processes sale as…">
