Responsible (R): Tax Accountant
Accountable (A): Tax Manager
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2906_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2906_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2906_Task8" name="AR archives exemption documentation; supports BIR audit of…">
