Volume: ~50–200 transactions/year
Owner: Tax Accountant
Participants: Tax Accountant, Trade Sales, AR
Source: workflow W2907 — Educational Institution &amp; Housing (PAG-IBIG) VAT-Exempt Sale Processing</bpmn:documentation>
